\caption{Release design. (a) V10 uses the same data to construct the interval and assess whether its width is small enough to release; marginal validity controls erroneous releases but not nominal conditional coverage automatically. (b) V15 uses an independent pilot gate and fresh confirmatory data, preserving confirmatory coverage among released designs.}
